{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "014hid_402_2_4_014_02_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:536c21ed069f143b364f356068471968938123010e20c11a2a30d81094264151",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:014hid_402_2_4_014_02_09_a:2_4_014_02_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b863189cddc7d838537e870980f4b92d79642e20d5eee0bd5d473fd14679662a",
      "text": "喂喂，●●●●プロデューサー？\n现在方便吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:014hid_402_2_4_014_02_09_a:2_4_014_02_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee7e6da0dd97e372ead5cb1a52c61b8a2ecda8b6c60ba7850a2ede0a85059727",
      "text": "没想到演唱会结束之后居然下起了大雨，\n完全没料到啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:014hid_402_2_4_014_02_09_a:2_4_014_02_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:04381c2cc92cb17606d6950b7942b4cb2ea52c75a8da8cdf19584579ebe224b5",
      "text": "哈哈，演唱会期间没被淋到，\n可以说全靠我们的强运了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:014hid_402_2_4_014_02_09_a:2_4_014_02_09_a:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35e5e9680bcb2eebe9294c2f2417e6bade52f84dd106e2c9b936f00dd8ffbb11",
      "text": "龙甚至还脸色发青地说：“差点因为我的厄运把演唱会搞砸了……”\n明明根本不可能的事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:014hid_402_2_4_014_02_09_a:2_4_014_02_09_a:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74502dbc42bf0d57ebc6e8e4269294ecec63a3e61a0cc8d83da0d4c8b3e3a124",
      "text": "就算下了雨观众们也舍不得离开现场，\n总觉得真让人依依不舍啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:014hid_402_2_4_014_02_09_a:2_4_014_02_09_a:cmd-000015:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6aea8544be4ea03bc94f219bc65d034515ad5d29d26d35a21968f7773d3da6dc",
      "text": "大获成功了呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:014hid_402_2_4_014_02_09_a:2_4_014_02_09_a:cmd-000016:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65dab8a098453271bbd02bab23e772ef3de38286653a89fe49240905f40b6a87",
      "text": "一定还能在演唱会\n现场见面的",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:014hid_402_2_4_014_02_09_a:2_4_014_02_09_a:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:311eb9db99e723fa4f3918652a8d75acb8d271fe747609be9c2f9928b6cc9caa",
      "text": "嗯，他们那么高兴的话，\n一定还会再来看的吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:014hid_402_2_4_014_02_09_a:2_4_014_02_09_a:cmd-000023:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1593d077721c9d2734aad8a60f4a56421c77e9c75f35b1de52900ae7e779cc2a",
      "text": "是啊，我也觉得肯定能再见面的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:014hid_402_2_4_014_02_09_a:2_4_014_02_09_a:cmd-000027:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:977583038d1264f5aa963abbc0f049d31897235ac8953e31f3f51133ad6939f6",
      "text": "为了到那时候能让他们更加尽兴，\n我们得更加鼓足干劲才行啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:014hid_402_2_4_014_02_09_a:2_4_014_02_09_a:cmd-000029:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea83905476ca696682865e0a9505b3103c81ead2e23bd0cdb9d184674491aed2",
      "text": "话说回来，雨势虽然很猛，\n停得倒也挺快呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:014hid_402_2_4_014_02_09_a:2_4_014_02_09_a:cmd-000031:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e3c05fdcc86145926481b684c1884ad9c2229b91c963852d04bd50f28a309bae",
      "text": "今晚估计会很闷热。\n那先这样，辛苦了。别吹空调吹受凉了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
